    "description": "Do not know how to do eye makeup, eyebrow makeup, face make up or lips makeup? Do you search simple makeup for every day or beautiful makeup for a special case? Then our makeup app Makeup Tutorial step by step is perfect for you and will be useful!\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Makeup Tutorial step by step - it`s cool and beautiful makeup tutorials for women and girls!\r\n\u2b50 This detailed makeup tutorials includes eye makeup step by step, lips makeup step by step and facial makeup step by step!\r\n\u2b50 Doesn't need network and Internet connection, all makeup tutorials are in the box. Makeup Tutorial step by step works OFFLINE! \r\n\u2b50 Makeup Tutorial step by step is absolutely FREE and very easy to use!\r\n\u2b50 You will see in Makeup Tutorial step by step beautiful, cool and simple makeup tutorials step by step with the high quality photos, easy DIY makeup tutorial and everything for FREE!\r\n\u2b50 You will be excited of the quality of makeup tutorials step by step and how easy to do our very beautiful, cool, stylish and fashion make up!\r\n\u2b50 If you want to learn makeup yourself, then our app is for you!\r\n\r\nApplication Makeup Tutorial step by step is very easy to use:\r\n\u2714 Download our app Makeup Tutorial step by step from Google Play\r\n\u2714 Open Makeup Tutorial step by step app \r\n\u2714 Select one of the sections of the application Makeup Tutorial step by step\r\n\u2714 Then choose one of the makeup tutorials in the section based on what you need: simple makeup ideas, makeup for office, makeup for holiday, etc.\r\n\u2714 Choosing a makeup tutorial, leaf through the makeup step by step tutorial\r\n\u2714 Share beautiful make up with your friends and family on social networks!\r\n\r\nTry beautiful Makeup Tutorial step by step for different occasions:\r\n* Makeup for every day: eyebrow makeup tutorial, nude eye and lips makeup tutorial, etc.\r\n* Makeup for office: nude makeup tutorial, eyes makeup tutorial with arrows, etc.\r\n* Makeup for school: eyebrow makeup tutorial, nude lips makeup tutorial, etc.\r\n* Makeup for party: eyes makeup tutorial with colored arrows, bright lips makeup tutorial, smoky eyes and glitter shadows makeup tutorial.\r\n\r\nTry beautiful Makeup Tutorial step by step for different ages:\r\n* Makeup for women: all makeup tutorials from app Makeup Tutorial step by step.\r\n* Makeup for girls: eyebrow makeup tutorial, nude lips makeup tutorial, cheeks makeup tutorial, etc.\r\n* Makeup for teens: almost all makeup tutorials from app Makeup Tutorial step by step.\r\n\r\n Makeup tutorials in different styles:\r\n* Classic makeup tutorials: eyes make up tutorial with arrows, red lips make up tutorial, etc.\r\n* Modern makeup tutorials: smoky eyes make up tutorial, colored shadows make up tutorial, glitter shadows make up tutorial, etc.\r\n\r\nEveryone can choose the perfect beautiful make up for themselves in application Makeup Tutorial step by step.\r\n\r\nMakeup Tutorial step by step works OFFLINE! Doesn't need network and Internet connection!\r\n\r\nMakeup Tutorial step by step is absolutely free:\r\n- no paid content\r\n- no registration\r\n- no coins\r\n\r\nUsing the application Makeup Tutorial step by step you will learn how to apply eye shadow, lipstick, eyeliner and other popular cosmetics. You will learn makeup yourself or your friends, because makeup step by step tutorials in app are very simple, detailed and clear.\r\n\r\nWe hope you enjoy beautiful make up with app Makeup Tutorial step by step!\r\nWe are waiting your comments and recommendations for our app Makeup Tutorial step by step!\r\n\r\n\u2b50Install our app Makeup Tutorial step by step right now, choose the best make up and do it yourself very easy! Do cool and simple makeup step by step OFFLINE! Look beautiful! Enjoy!\u2b50",
